    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d245">

                <pb facs="0342" n="268" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg268"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Bigelow</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 326.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-12-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 9, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have received your interesting despatch
                    of the 20th ultimo, No. 198, informing me of your proceeding upon learning of
                    the arrival of Admiral Pareja and his fleet at Valparaiso, and the
                    correspondence which had passed between him and the Chilian government. In reply
                    I have to thank you for the suggestions therein contained, and to inform you
                    that the exercise of your influence in the interest of peace is approved. For
                    more explicit instructions upon the subject, and for your information as to the
                    attitude of the United States in this question, I have to invite your attention
                    to my despatch<anchor n="*" xml:id="d245-f1"/> No. 324, of the 8th instant, and
                    its accompaniments.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Bigelow,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
